<h3>Disseminated gonococcal infection（DGI 治療）</h3>
<table class="ex-table">
<thead><tr><th scope="col">Indication（適應症）</th><th scope="col">Regimen（處方）</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>Arthritis and arthritis-dermatitis syndrome</td><td>Ceftriaxone <strong class="ex-n">1 g IV every 24 hours for 7 days</strong> plus azithromycin 1 g PO single dose</td></tr>
<tr><td>Meningitis and endocarditis</td><td>Ceftriaxone <strong class="ex-n">1–2 g IV every 12–24 hours for 10–14 days</strong> plus azithromycin 1 g PO single dose</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p class="ex-cite">Table 175-3，p.3212；內文寫 DGI 侵犯關節時 ceftriaxone 1 g「IM 或 IV」every 24 hours × 7 days（p.3211），表格只列 IV。DGI 可能因 septic arthritis、meningitis 或 endocarditis 需住院，p.3211。</p>
<h3>Neonates（新生兒）</h3>
<table class="ex-table">
<thead><tr><th scope="col">Purpose（目的）</th><th scope="col">Regimen（處方）</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>Prophylaxis（Table 175-1）</td><td>Erythromycin <strong class="ex-n">0.5%</strong> ophthalmic ointment 出生後立即點雙眼；或 ceftriaxone <strong class="ex-n">25–50 mg/kg</strong> IV 或 IM single dose，不超過 <strong class="ex-n">125 mg</strong></td></tr>
<tr><td>Treatment（Table 175-4）</td><td>Ceftriaxone 25–50 mg/kg/day IV 或 IM single daily dose × <strong class="ex-n">7 days</strong>（確定 meningitis 則 <strong class="ex-n">10–14 days</strong>）；或 cefotaxime 25 mg/kg IV 或 IM every 12 hours × 7 days（meningitis 10–14 days）</td></tr>
<tr><td>Gonococcal ophthalmia neonatorum</td><td>Ceftriaxone 25–50 mg/kg IV 或 IM，不超過 125 mg，single dose</td></tr>
